WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:22.500
Heat pumps are the future of residential HVAC. R-410A replacements are all heat
pump compatible.

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:45.000
Brazing joins copper tubing using a filler metal that melts above 840F.
Silver-bearing brazing alloys (such as Silfos) are used for copper-to-copper
joints. Always flow dry nitrogen through the tubing during brazing to prevent

00:00:45.000 --> 00:01:07.500
Here are the key terms. Write these down.

00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:30.000
Brazing: Joining copper tubing with filler metal above 840F. Used for
refrigerant lines.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:52.500
Nitrogen Purge: Flowing dry nitrogen through tubing during brazing to prevent
copper oxide formation.

00:01:52.500 --> 00:02:15.000
Here's why this matters on the job: A bad braze joint leaks refrigerant. A joint
brazed without nitrogen purge contaminates the system. Both cause callbacks.

00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:37.500
Watch out for these: ALWAYS purge with nitrogen during brazing. And — Heat the
tube not the filler metal

00:02:37.500 --> 00:03:00.000
